Package: tgskk-common
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), skkdic
Breaks: tgskk (<< 0.1.0-2)
Replaces: tgskk (<< 0.1.0-2)
Description: Shared model tools and workers for tgskk
 Includes the CPU inference worker and Google SKK server helper.
 Model weights are installed separately with tgskk-setup-model.

Package: tgskk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, tgskk-common (= ${binary:Version}), fcitx5 (>= 5.1.7)
Description: SKK input method for fcitx5 with local context ranking
 Uses CSKK dictionaries for immediate conversion, optional local AI ranking,
 and a bundled Google SKK server for readings without local candidates.

Package: tgskk-ibus
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, tgskk-common (= ${binary:Version}), ibus (>= 1.5.26)
Description: SKK input method for IBus with local context ranking
 Uses CSKK dictionaries for immediate conversion, optional local AI ranking,
 and a bundled Google SKK server for readings without local candidates.
